// NG-38 — spec §4 decision_log: apply/withdraw decisions with reason, decider and date.
// Append-only; the one writer of WITHDRAW is src/lib/k5-pipeline/withdrawal.ts, which also sets
// Opportunity.status = WITHDRAWN in the same transaction. Gate decisions stay in GateDecision.
// The composite key is the tenant boundary: a foreign key check does not go through RLS.
model DecisionLog {
